Because it disguises massive surveillance and platform capture as a harmless, pretty search bar!

3
00:00:15,363 --> 00:00:18,830
Look at the three hidden strategic objectives on screen:

4
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:21,220
Objective 1: Hotkey Hijacking.

5
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:31,570
By taking over `Alt + Space` (which used to be PowerToys Run or the window menu), Google intercepts your mental intent the millisecond you decide to search!

6
